WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:22.109
Roar! Eddy's engine started.

2
00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:24.799
His tires spun.

3
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.292
And he took off!

4
00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:31.628
Vroom! Eddy zoomed across the parking lot.

5
00:00:31.629 --> 00:00:37.960
"Go, Eddy!" Poppy cheered.

6
00:00:37.961 --> 00:00:49.221
"Woo-hoo!"

7
00:00:49.222 --> 00:00:52.928
"Eddy looks fast today!" said Jeb.

8
00:00:52.929 --> 00:00:57.739
"Yes!" said Dipper.

9
00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:00.716
Mr. Grill came outside.

10
00:01:00.717 --> 00:01:04.176
"Time for class!" he said.

11
00:01:04.177 --> 00:01:07.507
Eddy drove over.

12
00:01:07.508 --> 00:01:10.875
Everyone parked near the teacher.

13
00:01:10.876 --> 00:01:14.881
"Good morning, Mr. Grill," they said.

14
00:01:14.882 --> 00:01:18.252
"What's the plan today?" asked Dipper.

15
00:01:18.253 --> 00:01:23.886
"Is there a field trip?"

16
00:01:23.887 --> 00:01:28.551
"No," said Mr. Grill.

17
00:01:28.552 --> 00:01:36.972
"Will we go fast?" asked Zippy.

18
00:01:36.973 --> 00:01:42.612
"No," said Mr. Grill.

19
00:01:42.613 --> 00:01:47.923
"What will we do?" asked Poppy.

20
00:01:47.924 --> 00:01:50.719
Mr. Grill smiled.

21
00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:54.015
"We will stop," he said.

22
00:01:54.016 --> 00:01:56.918
"Stop?" cried Zippy.

23
00:01:56.919 --> 00:02:01.592
"That's right," said Mr. Grill.

24
00:02:01.593 --> 00:02:09.186
"Today we'll use our brakes!"
